      <pubDate>Wed, 16 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <description><![CDATA[<h3>Added</h3>

<ul>
<li><a href="https://developer.adobe.com/express/embed-sdk/docs/v4/sdk/src/workflows/3p/module-workflow/classes/module-workflow#migrateassets"><code>migrateAssets()</code></a> support for asset migration (guest to logged-in user) in the <a href="https://developer.adobe.com/express/embed-sdk/docs/v4/shared/src/types/authentication-types/#interfaces">Partner Assertion</a> workflow.</li>
