</ul>]]></description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>v4.54.18</title>
      <link>https://developer.adobe.com/express/embed-sdk/docs/guides/changelog/#4-54-18-2026-09-02</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">4.54.18-2026-09-02</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 02 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <description><![CDATA[<h3>Added</h3>

<ul>
<li><a href="https://developer.adobe.com/express/embed-sdk/docs/v4/shared/src/types/module/app-config-types/interfaces/editor-guide-config"><code>editorGuideConfig</code></a> property to configure visibility of Bleed, Margins, and Rulers in the Edit Design module UI.</li>
<li><a href="https://developer.adobe.com/express/embed-sdk/docs/v4/shared/src/types/module/app-config-types/interfaces/pdf-print-config"><code>pdfPrintConfig</code></a> property to configure print-ready PDF export in the Edit Design module (<code>"print"</code> variant), including Crop Marks, Bleed, Color Mode, and ICC Profile.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Fixed</h3>

<ul>
<li><code>createDesign()</code> with <code>"print"</code> variant now correctly displays bleed in the editor preview.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Documentation</h3>

<ul>
<li><a href="https://developer.adobe.com/express/embed-sdk/docs/guides/concepts/host-app-trigger">Analytics concept guide</a> explaining how to configure required analytics data for consistent launch attribution across Embed SDK workflows.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
