    <item>
      <title>v4.38.19</title>
      <link>https://developer.adobe.com/express/embed-sdk/docs/guides/changelog/#4-38-19-2025-11-10</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">4.38.19-2025-11-10</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 10 Nov 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <description><![CDATA[<h3>Added</h3>

<ul>
<li><a href="https://developer.adobe.com/express/embed-sdk/docs/v4/shared/src/types/design-config-types/interfaces/base-app-config#properties"><code>CCEverywhere.BaseAppConfig.useClientAuth</code></a> option for credit-free Generative AI workflows in Generate Image and Edit Image (enabled partners only).</li>
<li><a href="https://developer.adobe.com/express/embed-sdk/docs/v4/shared/src/types/export-config-types/enumerations/call-back-target#callback"><code>CCEverywhere.CallBackTarget.CALLBACK</code></a> export target to trigger callback actions without publishing or downloading assets.</li>
<li><strong>Custom Message Workflow</strong>: <a href="https://developer.adobe.com/express/embed-sdk/docs/v4/shared/src/messenger/message-types/enumerations/message-type#workflow_context"><code>WORKFLOW_CONTEXT</code></a> message type, <a href="https://developer.adobe.com/express/embed-sdk/docs/v4/shared/src/messenger/message-types/interfaces/custom-message"><code>CustomMessage</code></a> interface (instance ID, request ID, action, intent, and optional data), and <a href="https://developer.adobe.com/express/embed-sdk/docs/v4/shared/src/messenger/message-types/enumerations/custom-message-action"><code>CustomMessageAction</code></a> enum for unsaved changes and asset requests.</li>
<li><a href="https://developer.adobe.com/express/embed-sdk/docs/v4/shared/src/types/editor/app-config-types/interfaces/base-editor-app-config#properties"><code>CCEverywhere.BaseEditorAppConfig.canvasBackgroundColor</code></a> option to configure canvas background color in <code>RRGGBBAA</code> HEX format.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Improved</h3>

<ul>
<li><a href="https://developer.adobe.com/express/embed-sdk/docs/v4/shared/src/types/container-config-types/interfaces/modal-container-config#properties"><code>CCEverywhere.ModalContainerConfig.showExpressIconWithText</code></a> default loading screen includes the Express logo and text.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
    </item>
