      <guid isPermaLink="false">4.29.22-2025-05-28</guid>
      <pubDate>Wed, 28 May 2025 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><strong>Edit Image v2</strong></p>
<h3>Added</h3>

<ul>
<li><a href="https://developer.adobe.com/express/embed-sdk/docs/v4/sdk/src/workflows/3p/module-workflow/classes/module-workflow"><code>CCEverywhere.module.editImage()</code></a> <a href="https://developer.adobe.com/express/embed-sdk/docs/guides/concepts/edit-image-v2">Edit Image v2 experience</a>: 35–50% faster loads, 35% less memory, Adobe Spectrum 2 UI. No config changes needed.</li>
<li><a href="https://developer.adobe.com/express/embed-sdk/docs/v4/shared/src/types/module/app-config-types/interfaces/text-to-image-app-config#properties"><code>CCEverywhere.TextToImageAppConfig.communityWallConfig</code></a> to populate the Community Wall with custom images (see <a href="https://developer.adobe.com/express/embed-sdk/docs/guides/concepts/generate-image-v2#custom-community-wall">Custom Community Wall</a>).</li>
<li><a href="https://developer.adobe.com/express/embed-sdk/docs/v4/shared/src/types/editor/app-config-types/interfaces/base-editor-app-config#properties"><code>CCEverywhere.EditorAppConfig.showPageMargin</code></a> and <a href="https://developer.adobe.com/express/embed-sdk/docs/v4/shared/src/types/editor/app-config-types/interfaces/base-editor-app-config#properties"><code>CCEverywhere.EditorAppConfig.showBleedArea</code></a> options to control margins and bleed visibility.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Deprecated</h3>

<ul>
<li>PDF in <a href="https://developer.adobe.com/express/embed-sdk/docs/v4/shared/src/types/module/app-config-types/interfaces/edit-image-app-config#properties"><code>AppConfig.allowedFileTypes</code></a> for Edit Image v2; PDFs are converted to PNG. <strong>Action:</strong> Drop PDF from Edit Image <code>allowedFileTypes</code>, or expect PNG output.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Documentation</h3>

<ul>
<li>Enhanced <a href="https://developer.adobe.com/express/embed-sdk/docs/guides/concepts/appconfig">Editor Customization</a> concept guide with <code>assetCollection</code>, <code>showPageMargin</code>, and <code>showBleedArea</code> options, use cases, and examples.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
