    <item>
      <title>v4.2.29</title>
      <link>https://developer.adobe.com/express/embed-sdk/docs/guides/changelog/#4-2-29-2024-03-14</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">4.2.29-2024-03-14</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 14 Mar 2024 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
      <description><![CDATA[<p><strong>SDK v4</strong></p>
<h3>Breaking Changes</h3>

<ul>
<li><code>createDesign</code> is now <code>editor.create</code> / <code>editor.createWithAsset</code>; <code>editDesign</code> is now <code>editor.edit</code>. <strong>Action:</strong> Rename the calls. See the <a href="https://developer.adobe.com/express/embed-sdk/docs/guides/concepts/migration-v3-v4">migration guide</a>.</li>
<li><code>openQuickAction</code> is replaced by one method per action. <strong>Action:</strong> Call the per-action methods instead.</li>
<li><code>ExportOptions</code> changed shape. <strong>Action:</strong> Update <code>ExportOptions</code> to the v4 types.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Added</h3>

<ul>
<li>Generate Image module: <code>createImageFromText</code>.</li>
<li>Edit Image module: <code>editImage</code>.</li>
<li>Delayed login.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
